<name>Fusible Link Block Assembly (Engine Model 2AZ-FE)</name>
<para id="RM000002ZZ5000X" category="G" type-id="8000T" name-id="6808L-00" from="200612">
<name>On-vehicle Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000002ZZ5000X_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000002ZZ5000X_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000085O00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Fusible Link Block Assembly</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using a work light, check whether any fuses in the fusible link block are blown.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E140923" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<atten3>
<ptxt>If even 1 fuse in the fusible link block is blown or broken, replace the fusible link block assembly with a new one.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
